<title>SWEDEN: NCC says wins 200 mln skr Russia order.</title>
<headline>NCC says wins 200 mln skr Russia order.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish construction company NCC AB said on Friday its Finnish unit won a 200 million crown order from Swedish bottle and can maker PLM to build an aluminum can making plant outside Moscow.</p>
<p>NCC said in a statement its Finnish unit NCC Puolimatka would carry out the project at Naro-Fominsk which was expected to be complete in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
